<!-- Return and Refund Policy Header -->
<section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600 text-white py-16">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Return and Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl opacity-90">Last updated: <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Return and Refund Policy Content -->
<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8">
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-4 mb-8">
          <p class="text-blue-800 font-medium">
            <strong>Important Notice:</strong> Due to the digital nature of our software products, 
            all sales are generally final. Please review this policy carefully before making a purchase.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">1. Digital Products Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          PiSoftSolutions provides digital software products and services. Due to the immediate access 
          and digital delivery nature of our products, we have specific policies regarding returns and refunds.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">2. No Refund Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <strong>All sales are final.</strong> We do not offer refunds for the following reasons:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Change of mind or decision</li>
          <li>Failure to use the software after purchase</li>
          <li>Incompatibility with your system (please check system requirements before purchase)</li>
          <li>Lack of technical knowledge to use the software</li>
          <li>Dissatisfaction with features or functionality</li>
          <li>Account suspension due to violation of terms of service</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">3. Limited Refund Exceptions</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          In very limited circumstances, we may consider refunds for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li><strong>Duplicate purchases:</strong> If you accidentally purchase the same product twice</li>
          <li><strong>Technical issues:</strong> If the software is completely non-functional due to our technical errors</li>
          <li><strong>Fraudulent transactions:</strong> If the purchase was made fraudulently without your authorization</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">4. Refund Request Process</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          If you believe you qualify for a refund under the limited exceptions above:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Contact our support team within 7 days of purchase</li>
          <li>Provide detailed information about the issue</li>
          <li>Include your order number and purchase details</li>
          <li>Allow 5-10 business days for review</li>
          <li>If approved, refunds will be processed within 7-14 business days</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">5. Subscription Services</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          For subscription-based services:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Monthly subscriptions: No refunds for partial months</li>
          <li>Annual subscriptions: No refunds for partial years</li>
          <li>You may cancel future billing cycles at any time</li>
          <li>Access continues until the end of the current billing period</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">6. Custom Development Projects</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          For custom development projects:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Milestone-based payments are non-refundable once milestones are completed</li>
          <li>Project cancellation may result in forfeiture of paid amounts</li>
          <li>Refunds only considered for incomplete work due to our failure</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">7. Payment Method Refunds</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          Approved refunds will be processed using the same payment method used for the original purchase:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Credit/Debit cards: 7-14 business days</li>
          <li>Bank transfers: 5-10 business days</li>
          <li>Digital wallets: 3-7 business days</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">8. Account Termination and Data</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          Upon refund approval:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Your account access will be terminated</li>
          <li>All associated data will be permanently deleted</li>
          <li>You will lose access to all software features</li>
          <li>No data recovery is possible after termination</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">9. Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          If you disagree with our refund decision:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>You may request a review by our management team</li>
          <li>Provide additional documentation or evidence</li>
          <li>Allow 10-15 business days for final review</li>
          <li>Our decision is final and binding</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">10. Before You Purchase</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          To avoid disappointment, please ensure:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Your system meets the minimum requirements</li>
          <li>You understand the software's capabilities and limitations</li>
          <li>You have reviewed our terms of service</li>
          <li>You have tested our free trial or demo (if available)</li>
          <li>You have contacted our support team with any questions</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">11. Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          For refund requests or questions about this policy:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Email:</strong> support@pisoftsolutions.in</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 (797) 334-7442</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Subject Line:</strong> "Refund Request - [Your Order Number]"</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Address:</strong> PiSoftSolutions, India</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 mt-8">
          <p class="text-yellow-800">
            <strong>Note:</strong> This policy is subject to change without notice. 
            The policy in effect at the time of your purchase will apply to your transaction.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
